  "meta": {
    "notes": "Chains Policy Gate+Approval (calls 'Reeds - Policy Gate and Approval v1' as sub-workflow - set its real workflow ID after import) with execution, read-back verification, and governed memory write. Only gmail.* and sheets.* tool_ids are wired - add branches for other tools rather than a catch-all executor, so nothing runs against an unregistered/unscoped tool."
